  "body": "<!-- Release notes generated using configuration in .github/release.yml at v1.12.6 -->\n\n## What's Changed\n### 🐛 Bug Fixes\n* fix: reject reusing bundle releases published for another lfx line by @erichare in https://github.com/langflow-ai/langflow/pull/15657\n* fix(deps): dependency upgrades to 1.12.6 by @Adam-Aghili in https://github.com/langflow-ai/langflow/pull/15654\n* fix: 1.13.0 security backports to 1.12.6 by @Adam-Aghili in https://github.com/langflow-ai/langflow/pull/15655\n* fix(mcp): derive flow input schemas without running stored component code by @erichare in https://github.com/langflow-ai/langflow/pull/15660\n* fix: accept dictionary input in Type Convert JSON and Message outputs (LE-3003) by @erichare in https://github.com/langflow-ai/langflow/pull/15680\n* fix(lfx): handle numeric columns in Replace Value operation by @tarciorodrigues in https://github.com/langflow-ai/langflow/pull/15719\n### ✅ Tests\n* test: make WebhookTest.json fixture hermetic by @erichare in https://github.com/langflow-ai/langflow/pull/15724\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/langflow-ai/langflow/compare/v1.12.5...v1.12.6",
